# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local integration test environment (loaded automatically by Bun when
# NODE_ENV=test, e.g. `bun run test`).
#
# Only the DATABASE_NAME differs from the "client default credentials"
# declared in src/config/db.ts. Host/port/user/password are intentionally
# left empty here so they fall back to those same defaults
# (localhost / 5432 / postgres). This guarantees local integration tests
# never touch the development database named "products".
#
# Before running the suite locally make sure the database exists:
#   createdb products_test
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
DATABASE_NAME=products_test
